[469.865624, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[469.865678, "o", "### 3.1 Test Scenario\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[469.865722, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Duration:** 150 seconds\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
